# Brazilian Portuguese translation of ZacOS 9.
# A first slice: the Mouse control panel, every control panel's name and
# title, and the standard alert buttons, so the layout and the Portuguese
# accents can be judged before the rest is translated. The catalog is
# installed as "pt": the installer exports LANGUAGE=pt for pt_BR.UTF-8.
# Needs a native speaker's review before it is advertised as complete.
